LUXURY BIRTHDAY WEBSITE — QUICK START

1. Extract the ZIP file to a folder on your laptop.
2. Open index.html in Chrome, Edge, or Firefox.
3. Default guest password: Maryam
4. Click "Admin Mode" at the bottom-right.
5. Default Admin PIN: 8637Chumer@
6. Edit the name, subtitle, letter, comments, passwords, photos and music.
7. Click "Save changes".

IMPORTANT NOTES
- Changes are saved in your browser on this device using local storage.
- Keep using the same browser and do not clear its site data if you want to keep edits.
- Download settings backup from Admin Mode as an extra backup.
- This is a local starter website. The password gate is suitable for a personal local preview,
  but it is NOT strong server-side security. Do not publish private photos or sensitive content
  online using this front-end-only password gate. For genuine password protection online,
  deploy behind a hosting provider's access-control feature or add server-side authentication.
- Music: upload an MP3 file you have permission to use. Some browsers only start audio after
  the visitor interacts with the page.
- If the browser storage becomes full, use fewer or smaller photos (compressed JPG/WebP).
- To change the design manually, edit index.html in VS Code or another text editor.
